type: software
title: Loop Timing Witness
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-01
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23092361
repository-code: https://github.com/anulum/loop-timing-witness
url: https://anulum.github.io/loop-timing-witness/
abstract: >-
  Measurement instrument, in design, for hardware-timestamped latency,
  deadline, fault and energy evidence of real-time control loops and fabric
  accelerators on PolarFire SoC. The software implements hash-bound host analysis,
  native controllers and RTL/RISC-V simulation. Physical evidence remains
  architecture_only: no qualified board instrument or measured hardware
  performance result is claimed.
